Mi Pad 2 RT5659 UCM profile; devices: Speaker, Headphones, IntMic, HeadsetMic.

pkgrel8 supports both the 6.14 unprefixed Amp Input/Amp Input1 controls and
the 7.2 codec_conf-prefixed Left Amp Input/Right Amp Input controls. A complete
prefixed pair is preferred when both layouts exist. Partial/unknown layouts
are rejected before mixer writes. Both channels are selected before speaker
power is enabled. This keeps one UCM configuration across kernel rollback.

Real libasound 1.2.15.3/1.2.16.1 parsing and synthetic-control sequence tests:
  python3 fix_file/tests/mipad2-ucm-real-parser-test.py
Requires GCC and ALSA development files; --alsa-root accepts an isolated root.
These tests are not physical audio, DAPM, jack IRQ or acoustic validation.
